    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26260" root="طأ" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَأْطَآءٌ</span></b>  <i>A low,</i> or <i>depressed, place,</i> (S, O, K,) of
the ground, <i>that conceals him who is within it:</i>
(K:) or, as some say, <i>a narrow, depressed place;</i>
also called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَاعٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِعًى</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And A
<i>short, short-necked,</i> camel. (O, K.)

